< Cache-Control: no-store
< Content-Type: application/json
< X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
< X-Request-Id: golden-07
{"error":{"code":"invalid_argument","message":"Content-Type must be application/json","request_id":"golden-07"}}
## 08 schema that does not parse
> PUT /v1/schema
> {"schema":"definition doc {\n  relation owner: nobody\n}\n"}
< 400
< Cache-Control: no-store
< Content-Type: application/json
< X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
< X-Request-Id: golden-08
{"error":{"code":"invalid_argument","message":"invalid argument: schema: doc#owner allows unknown type \"nobody\"","request_id":"golden-08"}}
## 09 schema that refers to itself
> PUT /v1/schema
> {"schema":"definition user {}\ndefinition doc {\n  permission view = view\n}\n"}
< 400
< Cache-Control: no-store
< Content-Type: application/json
< X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
< X-Request-Id: golden-09
{"error":{"code":"invalid_argument","message":"invalid argument: schema: permissions in \"doc\" depend on themselves: view -\u003e view","request_id":"golden-09"}}
