## 12 README schema (demo step 1)
> PUT /v1/schema
> {"schema":"definition user {}\n\ndefinition group {\n  relation member: user | group#member\n}\n\ndefinition folder {\n  relation parent: folder\n  relation viewer: user | user:* | group#member\n  permission view = viewer + parent-\u003eview\n}\n\ndefinition doc {\n  relation parent: folder\n  relation owner: user\n  relation editor: user | group#member\n  relation banned: user\n  permission edit = owner + editor\n  permission view = (edit + parent-\u003eview) - banned\n}\n"}
< 200
< Cache-Control: no-store
< Content-Type: application/json
< X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
< X-Request-Id: golden-12
{"schema":"definition user {}\n\ndefinition group {\n  relation member: user | group#member\n}\n\ndefinition folder {\n  relation parent: folder\n  relation viewer: user | user:* | group#member\n  permission view = viewer + parent-\u003eview\n}\n\ndefinition doc {\n  relation parent: folder\n  relation owner: user\n  relation editor: user | group#member\n  relation banned: user\n  permission edit = owner + editor\n  permission view = (edit + parent-\u003eview) - banned\n}\n","written_at":"AQAAAAAAAAAB_IylAxEeI3spQXYjQmDnAw"}
## 13 schema in canonical form
> GET /v1/schema
< 200
< Cache-Control: no-store
< Content-Type: application/json
< X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
< X-Request-Id: golden-13
{"schema":"definition user {}\n\ndefinition group {\n  relation member: user | group#member\n}\n\ndefinition folder {\n  relation parent: folder\n  relation viewer: user | user:* | group#member\n  permission view = viewer + parent-\u003eview\n}\n\ndefinition doc {\n  relation parent: folder\n  relation owner: user\n  relation editor: user | group#member\n  relation banned: user\n  permission edit = owner + editor\n  permission view = (edit + parent-\u003eview) - banned\n}\n"}
