{"revision":"5","status":"ok"}
## 02 a token from before the restart still verifies
> POST /v1/check
> {"resource":"doc:design","permission":"view","subject":"user:carol","consistency":{"mode":"at_least_as_fresh","token":"AQAAAAAAAAAFs1ReST4Fc9SW3jc8dVWfeQ"}}
< 200
< Cache-Control: no-store
< Content-Type: application/json
< X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
< X-Request-Id: golden-02
{"allowed":true,"checked_at":"AQAAAAAAAAAFs1ReST4Fc9SW3jc8dVWfeQ"}
## 03 watch from the head token of before the restart
